{"id":"664319","name":"自制辣椒酱","author":"红袖添香v","authorId":"11598100","desc":"","cover":"images/664319/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"1斤"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜蓉","amount":"150g"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"50g"},{"name":"芝麻","amount":"70g"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"半个"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"10颗"},{"name":"八角","amount":"2个"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"1个"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"2匙"},{"name":"白酒","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"2匙"},{"name":"黄豆酱","amount":"2匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材，辣椒、蒜、姜切成细末。","img":"images/664319/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中倒油，油热倒洋葱炒香。","img":"images/664319/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入花椒、八角、香叶煸炒。","img":"images/664319/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"炒干、炒香后捞出食材。","img":"images/664319/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入姜末、蒜蓉翻炒。","img":"images/664319/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再倒入辣椒小火慢炒。","img":"images/664319/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入豆瓣酱。","img":"images/664319/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入生抽。","img":"images/664319/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入白糖。","img":"images/664319/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入熟芝麻。","img":"images/664319/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入盐翻炒大约10分钟。","img":"images/664319/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"锅中炒至水份蒸干，剩下底油时倒入白酒就可以出锅了。","img":"images/664319/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"蒜蓉味满屋飘香，蘸馒头、卷煎饼、就米饭都好吃的辣椒酱，自己在家也可以做。","img":"images/664319/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}